Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Preserve Drawless deeper-search boundaries

Preserve every RulesContractV1 terminal through selective main and quiescence search. Add exact material and no-legal child classification, node-neutral speculative probes, null/history and legal-en-passant state parity, mandatory terminal ponder handling, and orthodox-only Syzygy root ranking.
